You need to log in to Supabase CLI first. Run these commands in your terminal:

```bash
npx supabase login
```

Then after logging in:
```bash
cd "/Users/yashbaldha/Desktop/Shopify App/instantresumeranker"
npx supabase link --project-ref zkzontawprihrzpayeam
